classes\ that\ are\ XxxResource\ classes\ should\ carry\ no\ JAX-RS\ or\ Bean\ Validation\ annotation,\ because\ the\ XxxApi\ interface\ carries\ every\ JAX-RS\ and\ Bean\ Validation\ annotation;\ move\ the\ annotation\ from\ XxxResource\ to\ the\ method\ or\ parameter\ on\ XxxApi=f65260e2-62fd-4c46-bd88-45d0cde87c0a
classes\ that\ are\ XxxResource\ classes\ should\ implement\ the\ XxxApi\ interface\ named\ after\ them,\ because\ the\ XxxApi\ interface\ is\ the\ contract\:\ declare\ the\ endpoints\ on\ XxxApi\ and\ let\ XxxResource\ implement\ it=48350191-14fd-42aa-bfba-81fad08d1228
classes\ that\ are\ api\ main\ classes\ should\ be\ contract\ types,\ because\ API\ code\ holds\ interfaces,\ records,\ enums,\ exceptions,\ annotations\ and\ final\ constant\ holders\ (only\ static\ final\ fields\ and\ a\ private\ constructor),\ carries\ no\ CDI\ scope,\ and\ depends\ only\ on\ java,\ javax,\ jakarta,\ org.eclipse.microprofile,\ annotation\ types\ and\ API\ code.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=fdbeeb53-c034-4461-b527-8393080cf761
classes\ that\ are\ assignable\ to\ java.lang.Throwable\ and\ not\ are\ an\ exception\ mapper\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'io.freedriver.sms.errors',\ because\ the\ module\ keeps\ its\ domain\ exceptions\ in\ one\ package,\ io.freedriver.sms.errors;\ move\ the\ exception\ class\ there=b6d83f92-d886-42d1-ab6a-bbf8b3eb48a1
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ be\ implementation\ code\ when\ they\ implement\ an\ API\ interface,\ because\ a\ main\ class\ that\ implements\ an\ API\ interface\ is\ implementation\ code;\ a\ JAX-RS\ resource\ may\ implement\ its\ JAX-RS\ API\ interface,\ a\ generated\ MicroProfile\ REST\ client\ is\ exempt,\ and\ a\ record,\ enum,\ interface,\ exception\ or\ permitted\ subtype\ of\ a\ sealed\ API\ interface\ in\ API\ code\ may\ implement\ an\ API\ interface.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=37f7ef42-5cb9-43dd-aab1-a1a5ead6e4d2
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ be\ in\ a\ package\ that\ names\ a\ role,\ because\ a\ main\ class\ under\ io.freedriver\ is\ in\ a\ package\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ or\ below\ one;\ the\ utility\ artifactIds\ stereotypes,\ mcp-support,\ hit-window\ and\ freedriver-mqtt\ are\ exempt=937c74ff-74b7-41a7-b4d2-1c1caeac6f66
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ keep\ implementation\ packages\ private,\ because\ an\ implementation\ is\ a\ package\ io.freedriver..impl.<name>\ and\ its\ subpackages;\ only\ its\ own\ classes\ depend\ on\ it,\ and\ it\ depends\ on\ no\ class\ in\ a\ package\ io.freedriver..service..\ and\ on\ no\ other\ implementation=c87eb309-13ba-4417-bb73-a8c999035c3e
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ share\ their\ module's\ one\ role,\ because\ a\ module\ holds\ one\ role\:\ API,\ implementation,\ service\ or\ utility.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=13d6a0f1-821c-48c3-a060-fdec3c03e426
classes\ that\ are\ service\ main\ classes\ should\ depend\ only\ on\ the\ service\ allowlist,\ because\ service\ code\ depends\ only\ on\ java,\ javax,\ jakarta,\ io.quarkus\ except\ io.quarkus.mongodb.panache\ and\ io.quarkus.hibernate.orm.panache,\ io.smallrye,\ org.eclipse.microprofile,\ io.micrometer,\ annotation\ types,\ service\ code\ of\ its\ own\ module,\ API\ code\ and\ the\ utility\ artifactIds\ stereotypes,\ mcp-support,\ hit-window\ and\ freedriver-mqtt.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest.\ An\ HTTP\ edge\ class,\ one\ that\ observes\ io.quarkus.vertx.http.runtime.filters.Filters\ or\ io.vertx.ext.web.Router,\ has\ a\ method\ annotated\ @io.quarkus.vertx.web.Route\ or\ @io.quarkus.vertx.web.RouteFilter,\ or\ implements\ an\ io.quarkus.oidc\ interface,\ may\ also\ depend\ on\ io.vertx.core\ and\ io.vertx.ext.web.\ An\ MCP\ edge\ class,\ one\ with\ a\ method\ annotated\ from\ io.quarkiverse.mcp.server\ or\ that\ implements\ an\ interface\ from\ that\ package,\ may\ also\ depend\ on\ io.quarkiverse.mcp.server=ac0fcd9d-d870-4e3f-88fe-3451ab48442e
methods\ that\ are\ declared\ in\ classes\ that\ are\ XxxResource\ classes\ and\ are\ public\ and\ are\ not\ marked\ @ReturnsResponse\ should\ not\ have\ raw\ return\ type\ jakarta.ws.rs.core.Response,\ because\ a\ resource\ method\ returns\ a\ typed\ DTO\ and\ throws\ a\ domain\ exception\ that\ an\ ExceptionMapper\ turns\ into\ a\ status;\ a\ redirect\ or\ stream\ that\ needs\ Response\ carries\ @ReturnsResponse("<reason>");\ declare\ that\ annotation\ once\ in\ this\ module\ as\ @Retention(RUNTIME)\ @Target(METHOD)\ public\ @interface\ ReturnsResponse\ {\ String\ value();\ }=bdbff2c5-bc6a-46f2-84f5-33ead6dd5d99
no\ classes\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'io.smallrye.faulttolerance.api.RateLimit',\ because\ SmallRye\ @RateLimit\ is\ one\ bucket\ per\ bean\ method,\ not\ per\ caller;\ use\ the\ module's\ per-caller\ limiter\ (@RateLimited\ and\ the\ HitWindow)=c95f9429-61d3-497e-afe1-21ef0718e395
no\ classes\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['java.net.http..',\ 'okhttp3..',\ 'org.apache.http..',\ 'org.apache.hc..',\ 'io.vertx.ext.web.client..',\ 'redis.clients.jedis..',\ 'io.lettuce..',\ 'org.redisson..']\ or\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'org.keycloak.admin.client.KeycloakBuilder',\ because\ outgoing\ HTTP\ uses\ a\ REST\ client\ interface\ (or\ sms-client,\ device-daemon),\ Redis\ uses\ the\ Quarkus\ Redis\ client,\ and\ the\ Keycloak\ admin\ client\ is\ the\ one\ the\ Quarkus\ extension\ injects=bdabe815-7c2e-4587-bb79-fccb96cb3adb
no\ classes\ that\ are\ service\ unit\ tests\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'jakarta.ws.rs..',\ because\ a\ service\ unit\ test\ calls\ the\ service\ and\ asserts\ its\ result\ or\ domain\ exception;\ HTTP\ status\ belongs\ in\ the\ resource's\ @QuarkusTest=8e59fbab-70e2-47bf-a147-8545d0285ae1
no\ classes\ that\ not\ are\ a\ repository\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.mongodb.client..',\ because\ Mongo\ access\ goes\ through\ a\ *Repository\ (a\ PanacheMongoRepository);\ call\ the\ repository\ instead\ of\ the\ Mongo\ driver=dea2fd91-6a5a-46f8-b0f0-5b86681d63f9
no\ classes\ that\ not\ are\ the\ JAX-RS\ edge\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'jakarta.ws.rs..',\ because\ JAX-RS\ belongs\ at\ the\ edge\:\ a\ class\ whose\ role,\ its\ own\ or\ its\ package's\ as\ RoleRules.role\ resolves\ it,\ is\ one\ @PrimaryAdapter\ or\ one\ @SecondaryAdapter,\ or,\ for\ a\ class\ with\ no\ hexagonal\ role,\ a\ *Resource,\ *Api,\ *Filter,\ *Mapper(s),\ @Provider\ or\ REST\ client\ interface.\ Throw\ a\ domain\ exception\ and\ map\ it\ to\ a\ status\ in\ the\ module's\ ErrorMappers,\ or\ move\ the\ HTTP\ type\ into\ an\ edge\ class=b3f6b3d6-50b0-40a5-86dc-d90a563ab3a4
no\ classes\ that\ not\ are\ the\ security\ edge\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'io.quarkus.security.identity.SecurityIdentity',\ because\ the\ identity\ is\ read\ at\ the\ edge\:\ one\ @PrimaryAdapter,\ on\ the\ class\ or\ its\ package\ as\ RoleRules.role\ resolves\ it,\ or,\ for\ a\ class\ with\ no\ hexagonal\ role,\ a\ *Resource,\ *Filter,\ *Feature,\ MCP\ *Tools\ class,\ identity\ augmentor,\ authentication\ mechanism,\ tenant\ resolver\ or\ tool\ filter;\ a\ @SecondaryAdapter\ is\ outside\ that\ edge;\ pass\ the\ service\ the\ subject\ or\ roles\ it\ needs\ as\ plain\ values=7bac9c8f-1efd-4429-81b4-c2823956d0f8
